,"source_tag":"_t","target":"信件草稿（魔法大爆炸之痕）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"43c433702cea8b734912fcdddc6c554d66e2e833560a39fab4f9cce36bd99fb5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e5cb26773df7792f18ab4139dac05402541c5ceca49237fa12aa38c5359a6af","logical_entry_identity":"04cceff44c4e0b28c511933f0d26bd2a8e18991ba618a9d41dd538ce3ae53205","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"acid blind","source_tag":"damage type","target":"酸性致盲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c23ef42126f1788e787a8982dabbe1cf63899534b1b075eabacf174dc99a0002","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e5d9207553e05429647cf6310718a0ceadd564283e474db77f7742a7641d463","logical_entry_identity":"ef757e6c2da570d43504031a6b7618ada379b7b413c4fac4015dc0eed6021e48","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"phase door rune","source_tag":"entity name","target":"相位之门符文"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"54ca4c18c98257059bbeacf06b2025d9d573e0e31f961e58d5aa53128d610318","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e5f5ce882e0f12549b984e2899be0221c319121669b432a2106f97257f97476","logical_entry_identity":"e9dde013366f5ac2d51c7d3d1c585729aae9a9ac40e61893ca0ac3dd450633e1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Resonance Field","source_tag":"talent name","target":"共鸣领域"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5041624fa281daa9c3ef6650ecf2ba1a743795eb5269e2e83de5fc50f406d3bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e6c6f822f46eab2afac4694d76da8a83948deb2ef2be278b50f0fb36aa86737","logical_entry_identity":"f2641f83264752fe81435bf8bde748f1b85506914ab370785fcffa52c72c1db0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#From the notes of Darwood Oakton, explorer:\n#{bold}#CHAPTER THREE: DISASTER!\n\n#{normal}#Does my title not tell you enough? Disaster, and again disaster! True enough, these Sher'Tul ruins exist... several hundred feet at the bottom of a mighty lake! The lake of Nur, one of the largest in the old forest, has swallowed up the ruins in its murky depths. I am hardly a strong swimmer, gentle reader, but even if I could swim like a naga-spawned beast I could not hope to explore the ruin's sunken expanses before drowning. I fear I must abandon my present expedition... the trees are paying closer attention to me, and I do not believe it is of the pleasant sort...","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#摘自探险家达沃德·欧卡顿的笔记：\n#{bold}#第三章：灾难！\n\n#{normal}#标题说得还不够明白吗？灾难，彻头彻尾的灾难！夏·图尔废墟的确存在……却沉在一座大湖湖底，距水面足有数百英尺！纳尔湖是古老森林最大的湖泊之一，废墟已被吞没在幽暗浑浊的深处。亲爱的读者，我的水性着实算不上好；可即使我游得像娜迦所生的野兽，也不可能在溺死之前探索完那片广阔的水下遗迹。恐怕我必须放弃眼下这次探险了……树木正越来越密切地注视着我，而我看那绝不是什么友善的注视……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ae79817aa83f7b3acf7407575137e2209197d34a3f378e68fbcd847733bddd4e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e6cc55dd916f25a111bdfc33d151a40185662081ec9fd875b7e7d582e4a5b71","logical_entry_identity":"d562421d8b0318fd7f0050f77f79024e67da2f81343504653ccc113af49290a0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Glittering amulet.","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪光的项链。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"702404007a0e89e5043d3f29ccbb71669f35ead086977bf506dde9b9d01e858d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e718e2f837ddb31b08ca4eff7d1811d59147e6b04e2f2e8d5aa1c34e102e23f","logical_entry_identity":"48ecb8d982dc2fb304eca597f6da81f58d59e88b8187370c0d646e58f3411923","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"stave inc damage blight","source_tag":"entity name","target":"法杖 增加枯萎伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"541fcabc3dff4093a6f0129066d9d04b9d9a24996d023b6b15b0a868391a1135","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e71974ebe09b8069cd75894beb023a7b7456b3b830615d5dc9bcd701ef787bd","logical_entry_identity":"e8af619aa573293c341921dacd710f8d51f7a5102c64a84b7d24698d054d591e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Smash your psiblades into the ground, creating a tide of crystallized leaves circling you in a radius of 3 for 7 turns.\n\t\tAll foes hit by the leaves will start bleeding for %0.2f per turn (cumulative).\n\t\tAll allies hit will be covered in leaves, granting them %d%% chance to completely avoid any damaging attack.\n\t\tDamage and avoidance will increase with your Mindpower and Mindstar power (requires two mindstars, multiplier %0.2f).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向四周粉碎利刃，在你周围的 3 码半径范围内形成一股叶刃风暴，持续 7 回合。\n\t\t被叶刃击中的目标会开始流血，每回合受到 %0.2f 点伤害（可叠加）。\n\t\t所有被叶刃覆盖的同伴，获得 %d%% 概率完全免疫任何伤害。\n\t\t伤害和免疫几率受精神强度和灵晶强度加成（需要 2 只灵晶，加成比例 %0.2f）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7003348f63b0e55e793541016370160210a24172605d15b34a8961cea87c720","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e86b995ddc4b8a864b1e1ad05959e62c96525ad0e508d974eb8c47cfb2340f3","logical_entry_identity":"d62b537748b82dc8f3ed3d992fdc85a2ccfae6160cdfaab1c518b7ff1f386950","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have no more inscription slots.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你没有更多刻印槽了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f2da122a5769637bc283a8a5a4047688b6c411aac6d2d362aad3332217da628c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e8d336397b5e25d11d0db16057c4e8e30c0fd1ad6191ebc6421657ec224df93","logical_entry_identity":"aaab4d0105d5157bf161e3858adff1b34bd63b5cae1b44bf5cdf8c8d4765ca04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#* You have ascended to Lichdom!#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#CRIMSON#* 你完成了巫妖转生！#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4e328f224f654bc46758123ffa21b52c98bb6c002786bd767f6caafdff810cd3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e8ffef248488c816a3c5506428a8eba85d83ad531eca469455125f4c8bdf684","logical_entry_identity":"0fd93fdc8082ad6a02b4575cc65589bb5bddc6e2acaa5e168e49d06818e38b96","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The eye locks onto %s, freezing it in place!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"眼睛凝视着%s，将其石化了"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b5dc6c9e1f5cba742ee833c313bdb3413b6c0ce520a0dc4a659072e1263d2cc4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5e95388d189a9c5391aa242512dde89f6e244fd6489d138a6ed7aba19a77c172","logical_entry_identity":"adda023b1900e567213a337e1dc83d32aa8d10de9371ec